/-!
# The Kauffman bracket and Jones polynomials as Laurent polynomials

* `bracketPoly w ∈ ℤ[A, A⁻¹]`: the bracket recursion with `A = T 1`; `inWin_bracketPoly`: its
  exponents lie in `[−(3·len + 2n), 3·len + 2n]`; `evalAt_bracketPoly`: evaluation at `A = u`;
* `jonesQT_eq_bracket`: the quantum-trace Jones value is `(−A³)^{−w} ⟨B̂⟩`;
* `jonesPoly w = (−1)^w A^{−3w} ⟨B̂⟩` and `evalAt_jonesPoly`;
* `laurent_eq_of_forall_evalAt`: Laurent polynomials are determined by their values on `ℚˣ`;
* `jonesPoly_markov`: the Jones polynomial is invariant under Markov's moves;
  `not_markovEquiv_of_jonesPoly_ne`.
-/

/-!
# The matrix of a Temperley–Lieb diagram

`phi q n m` is the matrix on `V^{⊗ n}` of the planar matching `m` (see `TLMatrix.lean` for the
weights).  Main results:

* `phi_id`: the identity diagram gives the identity matrix;
* `phi_mul_E`: `phi m · E_i = (q + q⁻¹)^{updLoop} · phi (upd c m)`, `c = 2n - 2 - i`;
* `ptrace_phi`: `∑ₜ μₜ (phi m)(t a, t b) = (q + q⁻¹)^{closeLoop} · (phi (close m))(a, b)`;
* `qTrace_phi`: `Tr(μ^{⊗ n} phi m) = (q + q⁻¹)^{closeLoops n m}`.
-/

