* is recorded for `G`, as its minimal compressed DAG (whose unfolding is `p`);
* contains no `sorry`;
* is accepted by the kernel with conclusion `G`, i.e. yields a kernel derivation of `G`;
* proves a valid statement whenever the cited facts are valid. -/

